+To serve REST, UI, and gRPC over TLS, set `server.protocol: https` and provide existing certificate and key files. Startup fails if either path is missing or the certificate and key cannot be loaded. The HTTPS port replaces the HTTP port while HTTPS is selected.
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  https_port: 443
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/cert.pem
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/key.pem
+```
+
+`cors.allowed_origins` accepts one origin as a string or multiple origins as a list.
